  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_8671.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>&#39;L&#39;Associaci&oacute; de Motorets&#39; de Onda ha vivido la ma&ntilde;ana de este s&aacute;bado una jornada festiva, que ha servido adem&aacute;s para regularizar los datos de las personas asociadas y para insribrise aquellas que lo han deseado en la Font de Dins.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracioassociaciomotocultors/img_8612.jpg\" alt=\"img_8612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracioassociaciomotocultors/img_8613.jpg\" alt=\"img_8613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracioassociaciomotocultors/img_8614.jpg\" alt=\"img_8614\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracioassociaciomotocultors/img_8616.jpg\" alt=\"img_8616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracioassociaciomotocultors/img_8617.jpg\" alt=\"img_8617\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracioassociaciomotocultors/img_8618.jpg\" alt=\"img_8618\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracioassociaciomotocultors/img_8619.jpg\" alt=\"img_8619\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracioassociaciomotocultors/img_8620.jpg\" alt=\"img_8620\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concentracioassociaciomotocultors/img_8621.jpg\" alt=\"img_